      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Here&#39;s the wording of the original ruling on Miss Information to help: \n[quote=\"Christopher\"]\nThe card is not re-entering play. However, the Target aspect of it is. So, no, those cards are not re-entering play and do not need to be reordered or reactivated.\n[/quote]\n\nThe ruling can be found at https://greaterthangames.com/comment/25240#comment-25240.&nbsp; As Ronway said, the target aspect of Miss Information is entering play, but the card is not---which means Miss Information is not entering play as a villain card, so Buffer Overflow should not trigger.\n",
